# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# Every fourth RPDO2 of node 3 held 60 ms (with the 15 of the commit counted: seqs 3, 7, 11, ...):
# past its 48 ms deadline when it reaches the drive, while the drive stays enabled on the others
# (one missing SYNC: a 20 ms gap, 10 ms inside the 30 ms command timeout; the previous command,
# valid for 48 ms, outlasts it by 8 ms).
h2d 0x303/0x7FF every 4 offset 1 delay 60
